---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy | Regent Exterior Services" description="How Regent Exterior Services handles the information you send us.">
  <main id="content">
    <section class="page-intro"><p class="label">Privacy</p><h1>Your information</h1></section>
    <section class="section prose">
      <p>When you send a request through this site, we receive your name, contact details, address or town, and anything you tell us about your house. We use it only to reply to you, visit, quote and carry out the work you ask for.</p>
      <p>We do not sell your information or share it with anyone except where needed to do your job (for example, a permit application) or where the law requires it.</p>
      <p>Form submissions are processed by our website host, Netlify.</p>
      <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
      <p>When you first visit, we ask which cookies you allow. You can change your choice at any time with <a href="#cookies" data-cookie-settings>cookie settings</a>.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Necessary</strong> (always on): a cookie that remembers your cookie choice, kept for six months.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics</strong> (only if you allow): Google Analytics counts visits and pages viewed, and a cookie of our own remembers how you first found us (for example a search or an ad) for 90 days, so we can see which ads and searches lead to requests. That source is attached to any request you send.</li>
        <li><strong>Marketing</strong> (only if you allow): the Meta pixel measures whether our Facebook and Instagram ads lead to visits and requests, and may be used to show our ads to people who have visited.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your information. Google and Meta handle the data they collect under their own privacy policies.</p>
      <p>To see, correct or delete what we hold about you, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
